    "topic": "Collections",
    "prompt": "Write a method called partition that accepts a list of integers and an\n   integer value E as its parameter, and rearranges (partitions) the list so\n   that all the elements with values less than E occur before all elements\n   with values greater than E. The exact order of the elements is\n   unimportant, so long as all elements less than E appear before all\n   elements greater than E. For example, for the linked list [15, 1, 6, 12,\n   –3, 4, 8, 21, 2, 30, –1, 9], one acceptable ordering of the list after\n   a call of partition(list, 5) would be [–1, 1, 2, 4, –3, 12, 8,\n   21, 6, 30, 15, 9]. You may assume that the list contains no\n   duplicates and does not contain the element value E.",
    "pdfPage": 81,
    "hasFigureReference": false,
    "solutionVariants": [
      {
        "html": "<pre class=\"java\">\npublic static void partition(List&lt;Integer&gt; list, int value) {\n    // partition original list into a temporary second list\n    List&lt;Integer&gt; temp = new LinkedList&lt;Integer&gt;();\n    Iterator&lt;Integer&gt; itr = list.iterator();\n    while (itr.hasNext()) {\n        int element = itr.next();\n        if (element &lt; value) {\n            temp.add(0, element);\n        } else {\n            temp.add(element);\n        }\n    }\n    \n    // copy temp back to original list\n    list.clear();\n    for (Integer i : temp) {\n        list.add(i);\n    }\n}\n</pre>",
        "text": "public static void partition(List<Integer> list, int value) {\n    // partition original list into a temporary second list\n    List<Integer> temp = new LinkedList<Integer>();\n    Iterator<Integer> itr = list.iterator();\n    while (itr.hasNext()) {\n        int element = itr.next();\n        if (element < value) {\n            temp.add(0, element);\n        } else {\n            temp.add(element);\n        }\n    }\n\n    // copy temp back to original list\n    list.clear();\n    for (Integer i : temp) {\n        list.add(i);\n    }\n}"
      }
    ],
    "solutionText": "public static void partition(List<Integer> list, int value) {\n    // partition original list into a temporary second list\n    List<Integer> temp = new LinkedList<Integer>();\n    Iterator<Integer> itr = list.iterator();\n    while (itr.hasNext()) {\n        int element = itr.next();\n        if (element < value) {\n            temp.add(0, element);\n        } else {\n            temp.add(element);\n        }\n    }\n\n    // copy temp back to original list\n    list.clear();\n    for (Integer i : temp) {\n        list.add(i);\n    }\n}",
