        "html": "<pre class=\"java\">\npublic static Map&lt;String, Integer&gt; intersect(Map&lt;String, Integer&gt; map1, Map&lt;String, Integer&gt; map2) {\n    Map&lt;String, Integer&gt; result = new TreeMap&lt;String, Integer&gt;();\n    for (String key : map1.keySet()) {\n        int value = map1.get(key);\n        if (map2.containsKey(key) &amp;&amp; value == map2.get(key)) {\n            result.put(key, value);\n        }\n    }\n    return result;\n}\n</pre>",
        "text": "public static Map<String, Integer> intersect(Map<String, Integer> map1, Map<String, Integer> map2) {\n    Map<String, Integer> result = new TreeMap<String, Integer>();\n    for (String key : map1.keySet()) {\n        int value = map1.get(key);\n        if (map2.containsKey(key) && value == map2.get(key)) {\n            result.put(key, value);\n        }\n    }\n    return result;\n}"
