    "solutionText": "public static int maxSum(List<Integer> numbers, int limit) {\n    if (limit <= 0 || numbers.isEmpty()) {\n        return 0;\n    } else {\n        int first = numbers.get(0);\n        numbers.remove(0);\n\n        int max;\n        if (first > limit) {\n            max = maxSum(numbers, limit);\n        } else {\n            int with    = first + maxSum(numbers, limit - first);\n            int without = maxSum(numbers, limit);\n            max = Math.max(with, without);\n        }\n\n        numbers.add(0, first);\n        return max;\n    }\n}",
