    "solutionText": "public void reorder(Queue<Integer> q) {\n    Stack<Integer> s = new Stack<Integer>();\n    int oldSize = q.size();\n    for (int i = 0; i < oldSize; i++) {\n        int n = q.remove();\n        if (n < 0) {\n            s.push(n);\n        } else {\n            q.add(n);\n        }\n    }\n    int newSize = q.size();\n    while (!s.isEmpty()) {\n        q.add(s.pop());\n    }\n    for (int i = 0; i < newSize; i++) {\n        q.add(q.remove());\n    }\n}",
